# This .dockerignore sits at the service root for visibility but Docker
# applies the one at the build *context* root. With this compose's
# context=../.. the effective ignore file is at the repo root. Keep this
# one in sync if/when a root-level .dockerignore lands.

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/.venv
**/venv
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/*.md
!**/README.md
**/.DS_Store
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
old-structure/
docs/
.github/
